  m_text: "Hey, I'm Coach Byte! Before you step in the ring, I want a quick read
    on how you've been handling stress lately. 28 quick questions, about 3 minutes.
    There's no wrong answer, this stays on your device, and it's not a diagnosis
    \u2014 just how I decide which mode to point you at first. You can skip this
    anytime and pick a mode yourself."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
